    <briefdescription>
<para>Probability of collision algorithm (abstract). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Base class for algorithms that compute the probability of collision for a close approach.</para>
<para>The recommended way to use the algorithms is as follows:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>List the algorithms to use, in order of preference.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Loop over the list and pick the first algorithm applicable to the close approach (see <ref refid="classostk_1_1astrodynamics_1_1conjunction_1_1_probability_of_collision_algorithm_1aeaf739a3fc5bbc94f00bfacdfa34fa69" kindref="member">isApplicable()</ref>), then check whether it computes a maximum probability of collision (see <ref refid="classostk_1_1astrodynamics_1_1conjunction_1_1_probability_of_collision_algorithm_1a11cb3a2a30f70e8dd5ccecbadde74348" kindref="member">isMaximum()</ref>).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If the algorithm does not compute a maximum probability of collision, compute the probability of collision analysis (see ComputeProbabilityAnalysis) and check its region:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="classostk_1_1astrodynamics_1_1conjunction_1_1_probability_of_collision_algorithm_1ab68a8a2466868fb02312fd951dd0dd34acd8257a80d3498e67b8972607c8377c0" kindref="member">ProbabilityRegion::Robust</ref>: use the probability of collision.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classostk_1_1astrodynamics_1_1conjunction_1_1_probability_of_collision_algorithm_1ab68a8a2466868fb02312fd951dd0dd34ad93c90e25e2dd62f57b5983a12e1b0e2" kindref="member">ProbabilityRegion::Diluted</ref>: use the maximum probability of collision as an upper bound.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classostk_1_1astrodynamics_1_1conjunction_1_1_probability_of_collision_algorithm_1ab68a8a2466868fb02312fd951dd0dd34a88183b946cc5f0e8c96b2e66e1c74a7e" kindref="member">ProbabilityRegion::Unknown</ref>: try the next applicable algorithm in the list.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If the algorithm computes a maximum probability of collision, compute the probability of collision (see <ref refid="classostk_1_1astrodynamics_1_1conjunction_1_1_probability_of_collision_algorithm_1a3996b1b6fceb676d2873e924e06cd2d6" kindref="member">computeProbabilityOfCollision()</ref>) and use it as an upper bound.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>Array&lt;Shared&lt;const<sp/>ProbabilityOfCollisionAlgorithm&gt;&gt;<sp/>algorithms<sp/>=<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::make_shared&lt;Alfano2005&gt;(),</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::make_shared&lt;Frisbee2015&gt;(),</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">for</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal">&amp;<sp/>algorithmSPtr<sp/>:<sp/>algorithms)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(!algorithmSPtr-&gt;isApplicable(closeApproach))</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">continue</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(algorithmSPtr-&gt;isMaximum())</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Upper<sp/>bound</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>algorithmSPtr-&gt;computeProbabilityOfCollision(closeApproach,<sp/>hardBody1SPtr,<sp/>hardBody2SPtr);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ProbabilityOfCollisionAlgorithm::Analysis<sp/>analysis<sp/>=</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classostk_1_1astrodynamics_1_1conjunction_1_1_probability_of_collision_algorithm_1a173d741cf3aec10505010a3f08edcc2c" kindref="member">ProbabilityOfCollisionAlgorithm::ComputeProbabilityAnalysis</ref>(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>algorithmSPtr,<sp/>closeApproach,<sp/>hardBody1SPtr,<sp/>hardBody2SPtr</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(analysis.region<sp/>==<sp/><ref refid="classostk_1_1astrodynamics_1_1conjunction_1_1_probability_of_collision_algorithm_1ab68a8a2466868fb02312fd951dd0dd34acd8257a80d3498e67b8972607c8377c0" kindref="member">ProbabilityOfCollisionAlgorithm::ProbabilityRegion::Robust</ref>)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>analysis.probabilityOfCollision;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(analysis.region<sp/>==<sp/><ref refid="classostk_1_1astrodynamics_1_1conjunction_1_1_probability_of_collision_algorithm_1ab68a8a2466868fb02312fd951dd0dd34ad93c90e25e2dd62f57b5983a12e1b0e2" kindref="member">ProbabilityOfCollisionAlgorithm::ProbabilityRegion::Diluted</ref>)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Upper<sp/>bound</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>analysis.maximumProbabilityOfCollision.value();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>ProbabilityRegion::Unknown:<sp/>try<sp/>the<sp/>next<sp/>algorithm</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
